never have a problem vegan-izing the sandwiches. The salads are EPIC. Huge, and their dressing selection is enviable. The menu has definitely changed since I first started eating at rotolo's, but it's still good, and actually healthier. I would recommend this place for someone who wants to just eat some pizza in peace and quiet. No, it's not fancy, it's just a pizza joint. But, it has bathrooms and a full bar. My only advice to the management would be that if the staff is g..."},{"business_id":"4inlQasjjXIe-wK9Wce5qA","review_id":"MIXGX-XtJcCxbaoh-cAPwQ","date":"2011-01-12T06:55:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9171150922775269,"text_excerpt":"Great food and they actually carry Kroenenbourg! Can you believe it?? I have never had a dish here that I didn't like. I usually get the muffaletta calzone! Mmmm....so good! The \"Sweep the floor\" breadsticks are another fave. This location is HUGE, so if you have a big group, they can accomodate you and it is walking distance from good Quarter bars."},{"business_id":"4inlQasjjXIe-wK9Wce5qA","review_id":"epE6N9aodY5qNJPtfIj5dA","date":"2011-12-23T17:07:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9115456342697144,"text_excerpt":"Had the \"meat feast\" 8inch and it was great! Crispy and very fresh. You have bar or table option, very casual but friendly staff. You get to keep the plastic cups lol only weird thing is that you have to go out to the restroom. Great pizza!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
